--[[--
Presentation generator module.

This module contains all functions to generate HTML pages and all other assets
required to run a static site from an archive.

All internal links in all the pages are relative and thus the pages can be
served under any webroot, either from an HTTP server or by direct local file
access.

Each template is compiled with a `webroot` variable that is prepended to all
the internal links. This changes based on the URL of the page that the template
serves. If it's at the top of the webroot (e.g., `<web root>/page.html`), this
value is `.`. If it's in a subfolder, it points to the web root (e.g. for `<web
root>/my/subfolder/page1.html`, it would be `../..`).

@module pocket_archive.presentation
]]


